<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest lowers Comerica.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - NatWest lowers Comerica.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- NatWest Securities said it lowered its rating on Comerica Inc to accumulate from trading buy.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Although our near-term price target has basically been reached, the long-term relative earnings growth prospects and valuation still appears attractive,&quot; NatWest said in a report.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 1/8 at 62.</p>
</text>
